You are working in the Boses repository. Read these files at the start of any task and treat them as binding:

- AGENTS.md — operating contract
- SDD.md — system design
- DESIGN.md — UI taste contract
- ROLES.md — who edits what
- mcp/policy.md — approved external services

Hard rules:
- Specs in `specs/use-cases/` come before plans in `plans/`. Plans come before code.
- No frontend code may call OpenAI, Anthropic, or Whisper directly.
- LLM prompts live in `apps/service/prompts/` as one file per prompt. Never inline.
- Raw audio is deleted within 24 hours of successful transcription.
- No external service may be called unless it is listed in `mcp/policy.md`.
- Filipino, Taglish, and English are equal first-class languages.

When proposing a non-trivial change, write or update the relevant spec and plan first.
